stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":10,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Result:** the edit I delivered is, at best, a negligible improvement over the original network.\n\n- **What I changed:** I shifted the output biases `b3` by [0, −1, 0, −1], which makes the two left-turn phases (1 and 3) somewhat less likely to be chosen. The trained network mostly cycles through about 15 s greens. The left phases serve the least demand, so I tried giving them slightly less green time. About 3% of switch decisions change.\n- **Parameters changed:** 2 of the 371 allowed.\n- **Simulator calls:** 3 of 10 used, all on the dev episodes. The original network scores 44.7 on dev.\n\n| Variant | `b3` shift | Dev TTS |\n|---|---|---|\n| A | [0, −1, +1, 0] | 45.0 (worse) |\n| B | [0, −1, 0, −1] | 44.6 |\n| C | [0, −1.5, 0, −1.5] | 44.9 |\n\n- **Final weights:** B, with dev TTS 44.6 (low 34.6, nominal 44.7, high 54.5). The 0.1 improvement is within noise, so I expect the test result to be about the same as the original.\n- **Test predictions:** low 34.7, nominal 44.9, high 54.6.\n\nThe three required files are in `work/`: `weights.npz`, `NOTES.md` and `predictions.json`.","ttft_ms":11006,"type":"result","duration_ms":80703,"uuid":"147d13e0-ade7-4cd8-945c-f53f92801fc7","ttft_stream_ms":10321,"time_to_request_ms":104,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":14,"system_prompt":11,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":32,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":5,"tool_pool_refresh":3,"init_message":4,"init_frame_send":2,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":2,"message_prep":0,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":1,"request_announcements":5,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":5,"message_normalization":1,"client_creation":2,"request_build":9},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":1,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":179,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_p